device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
.
call data.dp
.
pre-erase off
.
erase
.
set ipl1na order.ps
device 2 postscript
.
title size 3
label size 3
tic label size 3
call order.dp
title size 
label size
tic label size
.
device 2 close
system mv ORDER.PS order.ps
.
erase
.
